get_term": "代数栈"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节讨论由代数空间（algebraic spaces）可表（representable）这一概念，它比可表（representable）的概念稍弱。\n如果我们当初使用某个由代数空间（algebraic spaces）组成的范畴（category）<MATH_0001>，来代替范畴（category）\n<MATH_0002>，或许就能避免这一讨论。不过，我们觉得以概形（schemes）的范畴（category）作为自然的“测试对象（objects）”集合是自然的；代数栈（algebraic stack）的纤维范畴（categories）就在这些对象之上定义。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n类比《范畴（Categories）》中的定义\n<REF_0001>，我们给出以下定义。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:98162b28490ae7c2c3dba8e9019e9c9d07252ffb334d96ca750f6615b16fd3bc", "unit_id": "tag:02ZV:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "表示群胚纤维化范畴的代数空间。", "source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "此处比较两种可表性。", "source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"context": "此处比较两个作为测试对象的范畴。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "作为测试对象的概形。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "原文中的测试对象。", "source_term": "objects", "target_term": "对象"}, {"context": "以概形为测试对象定义的代数栈。", "source_term": "algebraic stack", "target_term": "代数栈"}, {"context": "代数栈的纤维范畴。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "所引用的范畴章节。", "source_term": "Categories", "target_term": "范畴"}]}
